  "contracts": [
    "detached save/load protocol task JSON preserving extensions",
    "bounded in-memory records/per-task/aggregate UTF-8 JSON with failed-write rollback",
    "borrowed IStorage adapter with hashed opaque task IDs and real filesystem reopen",
    "strict bounded load validation, requested task identity and malformed UTF-8 rejection",
    "candidate persistence precedes visible task and SSE event commit",
    "failed terminal save cannot advertise completion or rerun native agent",
    "tasks/get fallback preserves metadata/artifacts and filters history without constructing an agent",
    "server shutdown cancels and drains accepted store reads; callback self-disposal/read cycles rejected",
    "borrowed stores/backends never implicitly disposed",
    "backend errors sanitized as correlated -32603; missing task remains -32001",
    "Framework request cancellation normalized to original caller token",
    "persisted task JSON alone cannot restart or adopt a native paused context"
  ],
